@node Numeric Type Categories
@section Numeric Type Categories

EIGHTBOL supports four primary numeric type categories across all frontends:

@enumerate
@item @strong{BINARY} — Unsigned binary integers, range 0 to 2^N-1
@item @strong{BINARY SIGNED} — Two's complement signed integers, range -(2^(N-1)) to 2^(N-1)-1
@item @strong{DECIMAL (BCD)} — Binary-Coded Decimal, for fixed-point arithmetic with decimal semantics
@item @strong{DISPLAY} — Zoned decimal representation (EBCDIC/ASCII encoded numbers as strings)
@end enumerate

